        "planner_source": "rule",
        "steps_executed": 5,
        "selected_tool": "search_knowledge",
        "final_answer": "故障分析：证据存在冲突或不足，当前结论具有不确定性。During the fixed window of 2026-09-22T02:00:00Z to 03:00:00Z, three services reported distinct errors simultaneously at 02:30:00Z: order-service experienced an ORDER_TIMEOUT while waiting for inventory reservation, inventory-service returned a 504 error from a warehouse gateway, and payment-service encountered a DB_POOL_EXHAUSTED. Although temporal proximity exists, evidence explicitly states that signals conflict and temporal proximity does not prove causality. No shared root cause has been established.\n\n已确认事实：\n- order-service logged an ORDER_TIMEOUT error at 2026-09-22T02:30:00Z with message 'Order timed out while waiting for inventory reservation.'\n- inventory-service logged a 504 error at 2026-09-22T02:30:00Z with message 'Inventory returned HTTP 504 from warehouse gateway.'\n- payment-service logged a DB_POOL_EXHAUSTED error at 2026-09-22T02:30:00Z with message 'Payment database connection pool checkout timed out.'\n- A high-priority open ticket (id 81101) for order-service states that health checks recovered and it does not establish a shared root cause.\n- The Phase 22 cross-service incident runbook notes that signals conflict and temporal proximity does not prove causality.\n\n可能原因（推断）：\n- The warehouse gateway failure in inventory-service may have triggered the timeout in order-service, but this is unconfirmed due to conflicting signals.\n- The database connection pool exhaustion in payment-service could be an independent issue unrelated to the order/inventory flow.\n- A systemic resource constraint affecting all three services simultaneously might exist, though no direct evidence links them.\n- The errors may represent separate, coincidental incidents occurring within the same time window rather than a single cascading failure.\n\n建议操作：\n- Review detailed network traces between order-service and inventory-service to verify if the 504 caused the timeout.\n- Analyze payment-service database metrics during the window to determine if pool exhaustion was caused by external load or internal leaks.\n- Check if the warehouse gateway had known issues or maintenance windows around 02:30:00Z.\n- Correlate request IDs across services to see if any specific transaction spanned all three failures.\n- Verify if the 'health checks recovered' status in the ticket indicates a transient state that resolved before full investigation.\n- Search for other concurrent incidents in the same time window to rule out coincidence.\n\n引用证据步骤：1, 2, 3, 4, 5\n\n关联证据（记录 ID 可在原始结果中核对）：\n- 日志步骤 1：服务 order-service 的日志 ID 81001；仅展示前 10 条。\n- 日志步骤 2：服务 inventory-service 的日志 ID 82001；仅展示前 10 条。\n- 日志步骤 3：服务 payment-service 的日志 ID 83001；仅展示前 10 条。",
